@startuml
[*] --> AdjustTime
AdjustTime: adjust time settings
AdjustTime --> Adjusting_Hour
Adjusting_Hour: adjusting hour
Adjusting_Hour --> Adjusting_Minutes
Adjusting_Minutes: adjusting minutes
Adjusting_Minutes --> Adjusting_AlarmHour
Adjusting_AlarmHour: adjusting alarm hour
Adjusting_AlarmHour --> Adjusting_AlarmMinutes
Adjusting_AlarmMinutes: adjusting alarm minutes
Adjusting_AlarmMinutes --> AdjustTime

AlarmOff: alarm is off
AlarmOn: alarm is on
LightOn: light is on
LightOff: light is off

AdjustTime --> AlarmOff
AlarmOff: view and adjust alarm settings
AlarmOff --> AlarmSettings
AlarmSettings: adjusting alarm time
AlarmSettings --> AlarmOn
AlarmOn: alarm is set
AlarmOn --> [*]

LightOn --> LightOff
LightOff --> AdjustTime

Adjusting_Hour --> Adjusting_Minutes
Adjusting_Minutes --> Adjusting_AlarmHour
Adjusting_AlarmHour --> Adjusting_AlarmMinutes
Adjusting_AlarmMinutes --> AdjustTime
@enduml
